1. WHAT IS KIBANA?
====================================================================

Kibana is the visualization tool of Elastic Stack.

It works on top of Elasticsearch.

Kibana never stores logs.

It reads data from Elasticsearch and displays it.

Examples

Dashboard

Visualization

Search

Monitoring

Analytics

